OL,3,GNEWSAM1 northbound shut due to
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the M1 in Leicestershire has
OL,7,Fbeen shut due to a crash involving
OL,8,Fmultiple vehicles.
OL,10,FIn a post on social media at 12:40 BST
OL,11,Fon Friday, National Highways said the
OL,12,Fnorthbound carriageway was closed
OL,13,Fbetween junction 23 for Shepshed and
OL,14,Fjunction 23A.
OL,16,FEmergency services are at the scene, it
OL,17,Fadded.
OL,19,FThere are delays of 45 minutes and five
OL,20,Fmiles of congestion on the approach.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
